<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0C9B06016" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Side Sill Outer Panel Removal and Installation
</title>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0097.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "104.891mm" ver = "01" gw = "341" gh = "281"/>
</figure>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C9B06016001">
<title>
General Notes
</title>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Welding method and number of welding points are the same on both sides. This repair instruction shows procedure for left side.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Part filled with foamed material is included in parts of this repair. Therefore, repair referring to 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0C9B06026">Foamed Material Filling Area Repair</intxref>
 for precautions and repair procedure.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
The dimensions shown in the figure are reference values when cutting replacement part placed on top of existing part. Determine the most appropriate cutting (or joint) line considering both size of replacement part and condition of existing part.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C9B06016002">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Mark at the shown position and cut side sill outer panel.
</ptxt>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
You may accidentally cut the parts under the side sill outer panel when cutting the side sill outer panel.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Take sufficient care not to damage the parts under the side sill outer panel when cutting the side sill outer panel.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Bend open 3 metal tabs (arrow) and remove side sill outer panel.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0098.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "154.883mm" ver = "01" gw = "496" gh = "423"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.394in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "6.693in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
<symbol name = "MANOTE" width = "5.132mm" height = "3.048mm"/>
1.
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
When heating around foamed material application portion to detach foamed material, be sure that temperature of said portion does not reach 170 &#176;C (338 &#176;F).
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
<symbol name = "MANOTE" width = "5.132mm" height = "3.048mm"/>
2.
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
When heating around sealer application portion to detach body sealer, be sure that temperature of said portion does not reach 170 &#176;C (338 &#176;F).
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C9B06016003">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Before conducting any weld, check installation position and condition for installation part(s).
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Side body outside: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9B04006"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Side body inside: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9B04007"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Perform repair while taking into consideration installation of parts that affect appearance. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9B04003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install new side sill outer panel to vehicle body and cut in stacked condition.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Repair foamed material. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9B06026"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Apply sealer to side sill outer panel.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install side sill outer panel.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct resistance spot weld or plug weld.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct continuous weld.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Apply anti-corrosion wax to back side of continuous weld part.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Bend in 3 metal tabs (arrow) of side sill outer panel.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0099.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "197.060mm" ver = "02" gw = "496" gh = "542"/>
